# Normalize the working tree to LF on every platform.
#
# This repository sets `.editorconfig` to `end_of_line = lf`, but a Windows
# checkout under `core.autocrlf=true` writes CRLF. Prettier then rejects every
# web file, so `pnpm format:check` fails in a freshly created worktree on files
# nobody touched. Declaring the conversion here makes checkout behaviour a
# property of the repository rather than of each clone's local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compressed seed data must never be line-ending converted.
*.gz binary
